DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Mellanox ConnectX adapter cards with Virtual Protocol Interconnect (VPI)
     provide the highest performing and most flexible interconnect solution
     for Enterprise Data Centers, High-Performance Computing, and Embedded en‐
     vironments.  Clustered data bases, parallelized applications, transac‐
     tional services and high-performance embedded I/O applications will
     achieve significant performance improvements resulting in reduced comple‐
     tion time and lower cost per operation.

